Description: port away from removed KMime::Message::Ptr
 KMime::Message::Ptr (a nested typedef on the Message class) was removed
 upstream. The free-standing KMime::MessagePtr alias (defined in
 akonadi-notes' own noteutils.h, `using MessagePtr =
 QSharedPointer<Message>;` -- already a transitive include here via
 Akonadi::NoteUtils::NoteMessageWrapper) is the replacement; this is a
 mechanical rename of every use, no behavior change.
 See memory/kjots.md in the aurupdater project for the full investigation.
